                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c156fdf-1936-34e8-84cf-f1eb7b717014",
                        "entry_id": "91765243-4363-3373-8465-470063fb22b0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. предписанная Кораном «священная война», которую должны вести мусульмане против представителей других верований препятствующих распространению ислама"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e56e673-ee43-4fd3-a671-22674e38847c",
                                "sense_id": "6c156fdf-1936-34e8-84cf-f1eb7b717014",
                                "text": "Так началась священная война, газават, против русских и кяфиров ― большевиков."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0d2a67a-4274-4651-9036-c2a6d57f533f",
                                "sense_id": "6c156fdf-1936-34e8-84cf-f1eb7b717014",
                                "text": "Когда между лезгинами распространилось учение, из которого возник мюридизм, и дагестанские нагорные общества признали над собой духовную власть Кази-Мегмета, тогда и чеченцы не замедлили присоединиться к имаму, проповедовавшему «газават», священную войну против русских, их коренных врагов."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe2929aa-7af2-4bba-b105-44b62011ef95",
                        "source_entry_id": "91765243-4363-3373-8465-470063fb22b0",
                        "source_sense_id": "6c156fdf-1936-34e8-84cf-f1eb7b717014",
                        "target_lang_word": "jihad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jihad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4039103f-08e1-322c-badc-32458d85e99d",
                                        "entry_id": "24d60e45-dcd3-3a3e-afb6-c9912daad303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A holy war undertaken by Muslims."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "735f80bb-2ea1-4ba8-9f03-c3584c102a9f",
                                                "sense_id": "4039103f-08e1-322c-badc-32458d85e99d",
                                                "text": "Young Iraqis of both sects obeyed the imams' ruling last week by rushing to conscription offices in hot, dirty, dusty Bagdad to offer themselves or their money for the jihad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0fb715f-71ca-4b5f-a73e-f19499027fa8",
                                                "sense_id": "4039103f-08e1-322c-badc-32458d85e99d",
                                                "text": "Small groups of killers, the scent of blood in their nostrils, now fanned out by taxi, bicycle or even on horseback into the surrounding countryside, spreading the word that a general jihad, or ‘holy war’, had broken out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd482747-e3c0-4ee1-ba93-d39c885af94b",
                                                "sense_id": "4039103f-08e1-322c-badc-32458d85e99d",
                                                "text": "The Jabhat al-Nusra media, with songs about jihad and martyrdom, is extremely influential."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c740a45b-342b-356d-a7e5-fc51cc796ebb",
                                        "entry_id": "24d60e45-dcd3-3a3e-afb6-c9912daad303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A personal spiritual struggle for self-improvement and/or against evil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eef2b30-09bf-49df-945d-e6f43279d00c",
                                                "sense_id": "c740a45b-342b-356d-a7e5-fc51cc796ebb",
                                                "text": "As a result, Amirull has renounced his radical beliefs in armed jihad and the use of violence. He now sees jihad as caring for his parents, improving himself, and contributing to society."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ccae829-a3b9-3baa-bb4a-9323d66872e8",
                                        "entry_id": "24d60e45-dcd3-3a3e-afb6-c9912daad303",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An aggressive campaign for an idea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a395f69e-5902-404b-b9cc-9e4195c02ca4",
                                                "sense_id": "2ccae829-a3b9-3baa-bb4a-9323d66872e8",
                                                "text": "And now, the prophecy. One will come, the voice from the outer world, bringing the holy war, the jihad, which will cleanse the universe and bring us out of darkness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
